.TH GXWI-SERVER 1 "2026-09-27" "Peios"
.SH NAME
gxwi-server \- restricted GXWI HTTP worker, launched by gxwid
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gxwi-server
.SH DESCRIPTION
An internal worker. gxwid supplies its listener and control descriptors and installs a restricted token before execution. Do not invoke it directly.

.SH SEE ALSO
The Peios learn documentation and installed registry manuals.
